{"chapter": "algebraization", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DXS", "placeholders": {"ITEMCLOSE_0001": "]", "ITEMCLOSE_0002": "]", "ITEMCLOSE_0003": "]", "ITEMOPEN_0001": "\\item[", "ITEMOPEN_0002": "\\item[", "ITEMOPEN_0003": "\\item[", "MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{F}_n)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\textit{Coh}(U, I\\mathcal{O}_U)$", "MATH_0003": "$M$", "MATH_0004": "$H^0(U, \\mathcal{F}_n)$", "MATH_0005": "$M$", "MATH_0006": "$I$", "MATH_0007": "$M \\to H^0(U, \\mathcal{F}_n)$", "MATH_0008": "$A$", "MATH_0009": "$n$", "MATH_0010": "$(\\mathcal{F}_n)$", "MATH_0011": "$X$", "MATH_0012": "$A$", "MATH_0013": "$I$", "MATH_0014": "$(\\mathcal{F}_n)$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{O}_U$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{situation-algebraize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{equation-guess}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-when-done}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b79f97df133d08f5960e6d90848fb9666b1a77d03ab170c585a7fc8f2b58c987", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7895970c3a7df41be35a746c65efe189047aa2e3a879ed8b4bf19444afe93510", "source_text": "In Situation <REF_0001> let <MATH_0001> be an object\nof <MATH_0002>. Let <MATH_0003> be as in (<REF_0002>).\nAssume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(a)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> the inverse system <MATH_0004> has Mittag-Leffler,\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(b)<ITEMCLOSE_0002> the limit topology on <MATH_0005> agrees with the <MATH_0006>-adic topology, and\n<ITEMOPEN_0003>(c)<ITEMCLOSE_0003> the image of <MATH_0007> is a finite <MATH_0008>-module\nfor all <MATH_0009>.\n<STRUCT_0002>\nThen <MATH_0010> extends canonically to <MATH_0011>.\nIn particular, if <MATH_0012> is <MATH_0013>-adically complete, then\n<MATH_0014> is the completion of a coherent <MATH_0015>-module.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:412569652ded3eedc1806e9dd6547e173ff3d45f0b9